msgstr "メールログを有効にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1945
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Email Log page becomes available and email send attempts "
"are recorded."
msgstr ""
"有効にすると、メールログページが利用可能になり、メール送信の試行が記録されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1951
msgid "Email log retention period"
msgstr "メールログ送信保存期間"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1965
msgid "Logs older than this will be automatically deleted."
msgstr "指定日数を過ぎたログは自動的に削除されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1975
msgid ""
"Even after registering as a new user, the user does not receive a "
"confirmation email."
msgstr "新規ユーザー登録してもユーザーに確認メールが届きません"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1978
msgid ""
"To authenticate the email sender and prevent tampering, emails that do not "
"have DKIM settings on the server may not even reach the spam folder."
msgstr ""
"送信者認証と改ざん防止のため、サーバーに DKIM 設定がないメールは迷惑メール"
"フォルダに届かないことがあります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1979
msgid "Especially if the user's email address is gmail, it will not arrive."
msgstr "特にユーザーのメールアドレスが gmail の場合は届きません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1981
msgid "Please check the following with the site administrator."
msgstr "サイト管理者に以下の事を確認してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1983
msgid ""
"Is DKIM configured on the server side for the domain where this system is "
