"The nomination feature can be enabled or disabled from the %1$sbasic "
"settings page%2$s."
msgstr "指名機能の有効・無効は%1$s基本設定画面%2$sから設定できます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:451
msgid ""
"To set the time slot capacity to 2 or more, enable the time slot capacity "
"option in the basic settings."
msgstr ""
"予約枠の定員を2以上に設定するには、基本設定で「予約枠の定員」を有効にしてくだ"
"さい。"

#. translators: %1$s: opening anchor tag, %2$s: closing anchor tag (基本設定画面へのリンク).
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:455
msgid ""
"The time slot capacity can be enabled from the %1$sbasic settings page%2$s."
msgstr "「予約枠の定員」は%1$s基本設定画面%2$sから有効にできます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:484
msgid ""
"Maximum number of people who can share this time slot when staff auto-"
"assignment is used."
msgstr ""
"スタッフ指名なし（自動割り当て）の予約で、1つの予約枠を共有できる最大人数で"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:485
msgid ""
"When a specific staff member is selected, only one booking per slot is "
"allowed."
msgstr "スタッフを指名した予約は常に1対1のため、この設定は適用されません。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:486
msgid "Default is 1."
msgstr "未設定の場合は1です。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:492
#: src/blocks/class-menu-loop-block.php:1005
msgid "Minimum participants to confirm"
msgstr "最少催行人数"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:497
msgid ""
"When bookings sharing the same time slot reach this number, the session is "
"treated as confirmed."
msgstr ""
"同じ時間枠の予約人数の合計がこの人数に達すると、開催決定とみなされます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:498
msgid "Enter 0 to disable the minimum and accept any number of bookings."
msgstr "0 を入力すると最少催行人数を無効にし、何件でも予約を受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:499
msgid "Values above the time slot capacity are reduced to that capacity."
msgstr "予約枠の定員を超える値は、その定員に切り詰められます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:505
msgid "Booking multiple people at once"
msgstr "複数人一括予約"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:510
msgid "Allow the same user to book for multiple people at once"
msgstr "同じ利用者がまとめて複数人分を予約できるようにする"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:513
msgid ""
"A single booking can reserve for multiple people by entering the number of "
"people."
msgstr "人数を入力すると、1件の予約でまとめて複数人分を予約できます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:514
msgid ""
"The maximum number per booking is the time slot capacity, because each "
"booking is assigned to a single staff member."
msgstr ""
"1件の予約は1人のスタッフに割り当てられるため、1予約あたりの最大人数は予約枠の"
"定員になります。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:515
msgid "The price is multiplied by the number of people."
msgstr "料金は人数分が掛けられます。"

#. translators: %s: Provider settings page link to customize the quantity heading and unit.
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:519
msgid "You can customize the quantity heading and unit in %s."
msgstr "数量の見出しと単位は %s でカスタマイズできます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:526
msgid ""
"When this is enabled and the time slot capacity is 2 or more, settings such "
"as minimum participants, private booking, and price categories are shown."
msgstr ""
"これを有効にして予約枠の定員が2以上のとき、最少催行人数・貸し切り予約・料金区"
"分などの設定が表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:546
msgid ""
"Setting the time slot capacity and staff auto-assignment are available in "
"the Pro edition."
msgstr "予約枠の定員の設定とスタッフ自動アサインはPro版で利用できます。"

